"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"run.bat" execute the Entities application from the jar
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"Entities.class" Entities main Java program compiled byte code
"ArrowNonets.class" alternate Java program compiled byte code
"DeEntify.class" alternate Java program compiled byte code
"Entify.class" alternate Java program compiled byte code
"Flatten.class" alternate Java program compiled byte code
"entities.exe" JET executable Converts HTML/XML/XHTML entities to char and back, also strips HTML/XML/XHTML tags
"arrownonets.exe" JET executable
"deentify.exe" JET executable
"entify.exe" JET executable
"flatten.exe" JET executable
