"E:\sys\arrownonets.exe" JET executable
"E:\sys\deentify.exe" JET executable
"E:\sys\entify.exe" JET executable
"E:\sys\flatten.exe" JET executable
"entities.manual.html" detailed HTML manual for the Entities project
"entities.jar" jarred class files: Converts HTML/XML/XHTML entities to char and back, also strips HTML/XML/XHTML tags
"entities.look" uncommented jar manifest
"arrownonets.jar" jarred class files.
"arrownonets.look" uncommented jar manifest
"deentify.jar" jarred class files.
"deentify.look" uncommented jar manifest
"entify.jar" jarred class files.
"entify.look" uncommented jar manifest
