"entities.jnlp" entities jnlp Java Web Start launch
"entities.efs" generated: JET compiler internal file
"entities.rfs" generated: JET compiler control file
"entities.rsp" JET configuration file
"entities.usg" generated: JET compiler method use tracking
"entities-setup.exe" JET distributable, containing runtime
"entities.ico" Windows icon for the project, contains multiple image sizes
"entities.jpn" Manifest of what is included in the JET executable.
"entities.log" log of what JET did compiling and preparing the distributable
"entities.prj" JET project configuration, compiler options and notes on what needs to be included.
"entities.startup" List of classes JET should preload for speed.
"entities.xbind.script" List of DLLs JET will need to run the app.
"build_entities.bat" Build JET executable with project descriptor
"run_entities.bat" Runs the JET executable with default parm.
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"package-info.java" Dummy Java source with JavaDoc describing the entire package.
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"mindprodcert2017rsa.cer" Public key for Mindprod code-signing certificate. Cannot be used to sign jars.
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the Entities project files
"entities.use" precis(summary) Converts HTML/XML/XHTML entities to char and back, also strips HTML/XML/XHTML tags Generated
"entities.vpj" Slick Edit project ini file
"entities.vpw" Slick Edit project ini file
"entities.vtg" Slick Edit binary tag xref file
"entities.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the Entities project
"entities.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the Entities project
"entities.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the Entities project
"entities.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the Entities project
"entities.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the Entities project
"entities.screenshot.png" screenshot for the Entities project
"entities.splash.gif" splash gif for the Entities project
"entities.icon32.gif" 32x32 gif icon for the Entities project
"entities.icon64.gif" 64x64 gif icon for the Entities project
"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for Entities, with one line descriptions.
"use.txt" key facts about the Entities project. Generates entities.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the Entities project. Generates entities.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the Entities project. Generates entities.use
"entities.txt" ASCII text manual for the Entities project.
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for Entities
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for Entities
"forgather.xml" list of extra gather steps for ANT.
"forjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in entities.jar
"forjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in entities.jar
"forarrownonetsjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in arrownonets.jar
"forarrownonetsjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in arrownonets.jar
"fordeentifyjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in deentify.jar
"fordeentifyjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in deentify.jar
"forentifyjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in entify.jar
"forentifyjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in entify.jar
"forflattenjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in flatten.jar
"forflattenjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in flatten.jar
"forpost.xml" list of extra posting steps for ANT.
"forzip.xml" list of extra files for ANT include in entities33.zip
